{"id":"input-4deccd207a8d","steamAppId":"700600","name":"Evil Genius 2: World Domination","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/library_600x900.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/700600/","genres":["Simulation","Strategy"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":18.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"18 GB"},"verificationStatus":"needs_verification","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-4deccd207a8d","canonicalId":null,"suppliedName":"Evil Genius 2","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/library_600x900.jpg","officialName":"Evil Genius 2: World Domination","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2021,"developers":["Rebellion"],"publishers":["Rebellion"],"platforms":["windows"],"genres":["Simulation","Strategy"],"shortDescription":"A satirical spy-fi lair builder where YOU are the criminal mastermind! Construct your base, train your minions, defend your operations from the Forces of Justice, and achieve global domination!","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"700600"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/700600/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T10:02:25.931Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"medium","status":"needs_verification","verificationNotes":["The supplied name does not exactly match Steam's official name “Evil Genius 2: World Domination” for App ID 700600.","Confirm the edition or alias using another authoritative source before linking a canonical ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:02:25.931Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"700600","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/700600/","officialWebsite":"https://evilgeniusgame.com/","support":"https://support.rebellion.com/"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":18,"unit":"GB","display":"18 GB","approximateBytes":18000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 18 GB"},"recommended":{"value":18,"unit":"GB","display":"18 GB","approximateBytes":18000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 18 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"full","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Simulation","Strategy"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"700600","steamName":"Evil Genius 2: World Domination","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/700600/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:39:40.782679+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"A satirical spy-fi lair builder where YOU are the criminal mastermind! Construct your base, train your minions, defend your operations from the Forces of Justice, and achieve global domination!","detailedDescription":"Season Pass\n\nPrepare for a Season of Infamy with the Evil Genius 2 Season Pass! Get a whole new Genius, Campaign, Henchmen, Island Lair Location and more!\n\nIncluded in the Season Pass:\n• 1 Campaign Pack\n• 1 Lair Items Pack\n• 2 Henchmen Packs\n• 2 Minion Packs\n\nSeason Pass is included as part of the Deluxe Edition\n\nAbout the Game\nThe World Is JUST Enough!\n\nEvil Genius 2 is a satirical spy-fi lair builder, where players take control of an Evil Genius and set their plans for world domination in motion. When it feels this good to be bad, the Forces of Justice don’t stand a chance!\n\nBuild your own unique evil lair and cover operation, Train a force of criminal minions, Defend your Lair from the Forces of Justice, and Dominate the world with a Doomsday Device in this direct sequel to the 2004 cult classic!\nCruel Constructions!\n\nEvery villain needs an island lair, so pick your paradise and put your own sinister stamp on it! Shape the internal structure of your hazardous hideaway to fit your play-style, and construct wonderfully wicked devices for your minions to put to use.\nAtrocious Anti-Heroes!\n\nCompetence isn’t going to cut it when you’re running an evil operation. As you expand and train your minion workforce, you can create new specialists to help further your evil plans! Need something a little more…intimidating? Recruit powerful Henchmen that complement your play style; every mastermind needs a right hand…or several, in fact!\nDastardly Devices!\n\nThe Forces of Justice are annoyingly punctual, so supplement your brute force by researching and developing a series of trap networks! Send those do-gooders spinning with a Pinball Bumper, or put the chomp on them with the Venus Spy-Trap. While one trap is good, more is…evil-er. Combo your traps to banish intruders for good!\nNefarious Plots!\n\nCarry out evil schemes to further your plot to build a Doomsday Device and dominate the world! Sell the British Royal Family, Kidnap the Governor of Maine, and literally BAKE ALASKA. With hundreds of potential objectives, variety is the spice of strife.\n\nGifs are taken from pre-release footage","aboutGame":"The World Is JUST Enough!\n\nEvil Genius 2 is a satirical spy-fi lair builder, where players take control of an Evil Genius and set their plans for world domination in motion. When it feels this good to be bad, the Forces of Justice don’t stand a chance!\n\nBuild your own unique evil lair and cover operation, Train a force of criminal minions, Defend your Lair from the Forces of Justice, and Dominate the world with a Doomsday Device in this direct sequel to the 2004 cult classic!\nCruel Constructions!\n\nEvery villain needs an island lair, so pick your paradise and put your own sinister stamp on it! Shape the internal structure of your hazardous hideaway to fit your play-style, and construct wonderfully wicked devices for your minions to put to use.\nAtrocious Anti-Heroes!\n\nCompetence isn’t going to cut it when you’re running an evil operation. As you expand and train your minion workforce, you can create new specialists to help further your evil plans! Need something a little more…intimidating? Recruit powerful Henchmen that complement your play style; every mastermind needs a right hand…or several, in fact!\nDastardly Devices!\n\nThe Forces of Justice are annoyingly punctual, so supplement your brute force by researching and developing a series of trap networks! Send those do-gooders spinning with a Pinball Bumper, or put the chomp on them with the Venus Spy-Trap. While one trap is good, more is…evil-er. Combo your traps to banish intruders for good!\nNefarious Plots!\n\nCarry out evil schemes to further your plot to build a Doomsday Device and dominate the world! Sell the British Royal Family, Kidnap the Governor of Maine, and literally BAKE ALASKA. With hundreds of potential objectives, variety is the spice of strife.\n\nGifs are taken from pre-release footage"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/header.jpg?t=1734453187"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1734453187"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_81be83ca4af7990c47647a64f2c34f9674ba620a.600x338.jpg?t=1734453187","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_81be83ca4af7990c47647a64f2c34f9674ba620a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734453187"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_9906e05aed31aa7b832d7427b7ad4439b72bdcb5.600x338.jpg?t=1734453187","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_9906e05aed31aa7b832d7427b7ad4439b72bdcb5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734453187"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_7dd1d36681aeae605cf39a163eb3004f37e436ed.600x338.jpg?t=1734453187","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_7dd1d36681aeae605cf39a163eb3004f37e436ed.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734453187"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_5f05fedddbc07f2557b574cf4c4c6be645335d60.600x338.jpg?t=1734453187","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_5f05fedddbc07f2557b574cf4c4c6be645335d60.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734453187"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700600/ss_5d0900b7dfef5d884b7735dfc1152d8c18628117.600x338.jpg?t=1734453